Night passes as sages wish Śatrughna victory --- Hungry Lavaṇa leaves city seeking food at dawn --- Śatrughna crosses Yamunā and waits armed at gate --- Lavaṇa returns midday bearing thousands of creatures --- Lavaṇa mocks Śatrughna as easy mouthful craving death --- Enraged Śatrughna glows and demands single duel --- Śatrughna declares himself Daśaratha son seeking Lavaṇa death --- Lavaṇa recalls Rāma killing kinsman Rāvaṇa and offers battle --- Śatrughna refuses fleeing foe respite to fetch weapon